  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2128\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150810065423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 81smallstars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_81smallstars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2124\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2124\">2124</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 7, 2128</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2132\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2132\">2132</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All elligable voters who participate</small><br /><small>51% of the vote votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">72.9%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/1b/Thang_Levin_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20151115183051\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Thang Levin Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/1b/Thang_Levin_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151115183051\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Thang Levin Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Thang_Levin_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thang_Levin\" title=\"Thang Levin\">Thang Levin</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Yanna Lynne\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Union\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Oregon\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Colorado\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Castillo\" title=\"David Castillo\">David Castillo</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Robert K. Mackenzie\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">145,849,620\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">81,165,783\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">46.9%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">26.1%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Avery Johnson\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Eliza Jin Tao\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Liberal\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Maryland\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Colorado\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Mike Jacobi\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Syng Anderson\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">55,043,463\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">28,921,147\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">17.7%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">9.3%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Miriam_Weinstein\" title=\"Miriam Weinstein\">Miriam Weinstein</a><br />\nProgressive\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Thang_Levin\" title=\"Thang Levin\">Thang Levin</a><br />\nConservative\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2128</b> was the 86th quadrennial presidential election. <a href=\"/wiki/Thang_Levin\" title=\"Thang Levin\">Thang Levin</a> won the election.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081234\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2731/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14093/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3854/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 11/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032113/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.354      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   65.354      1 -total\n 80.39%   52.535      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 30.25%   19.767     11 Template:Ifempty\n 11.69%    7.638      6 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  6.90%    4.508      1 Template:Flagicon\n  4.79%    3.133      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  2.40%    1.566      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n  2.29%    1.496     48 Template:!-\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1875-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119081234 and revision id 10475. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
